5e73d898b978d190374e0ebb89029eff4fb361afa","logical_entry_identity":"e68c5ba8775a6f92dd972a22b0de3981ae50ce9531c6ce1ef29722a92fc487a0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Glory to you, you are now the new master and your future characters will challenge you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"荣耀属于你！你已成为新的竞技场主宰，未来的角色将向你发起挑战。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c5e4725225c8c5a6a9f2074cd007732d7397dc69babd210ce537d11a5f5bd2f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ac669623f11ef7f24a8a03577bc4907bea475fc6949bd909f5b116c6b455ceb3","logical_entry_identity":"254b42dbae09e11b07661de3e7e387ceef5a9a7c0bc0c1f504a14e2d388f6112","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Born the 23th Allure, Year of Pyre 682\nDied the 2th Summertide, Year of Ascendancy 108\n\nKing of Kings, Founder of Last Hope, Purger of Orcs, Father of the Age of Ascendancy. Great is the memory of the warrior who fought for peace, and won.\nQuoth King Toknor: \"I have lived for the future, a future of peace and prosperity, a future free for all. How happy I am to see that future now... Aye, and it is brighter than any sword, and stronger than any armour, and more enduring than any war. Though warrior I am in flesh and mind, my heart belongs to peace.\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"生于烈火纪682年，厄流月23日\n死于卓越纪108年，夏殇2日\n\n万王之王，最后的希望创始人，兽人清剿者，卓越纪的缔造者。这位为和平而战并赢得胜利的战士，值得世人永远铭记。\n图库纳国王曾言：“我为未来而活——一个和平繁荣、人人自由的未来。如今能亲眼见到这个未来，我何其欣慰……是啊，它比任何刀剑更明亮，比任何护甲更坚固，比任何战争更长久。纵然我在肉体与思想上都是一名战士，我的心却属于和平。”"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f4cb96e6fcaa16324d26c4839aa2a5112ec88e27eac0cb60b79adfea414cf4c6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ac66ca54b29bb92574ef71df02acffb16a1eb8cd0846c22522e6e752750b6659","logical_entry_identity":"7ebaf2e30299a79c5741d4cbaf8cdd3b05f923500d25595235aa66510f2659c1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gnashing Teeth","source_tag":"talent name","target":"咬牙切齿"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f7074be3a57a53aec008a86329674fd6cb5a6b8c142f5cf341b6c4c780be7cc3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ac6a53740942a407ba3b8615915d8cbdf06fbcdeea1c12070d6c136a5d8ecfd9","logical_entry_identity":"12b7e3944a588e628d8ccb13bab63cd7049ad5ef9bbcbb8bc75926d338736e87","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You demonstrate your dedication to the light with a measured attack striking once with your weapon for %d%% Light damage and once with your shield for %d%% Light damage.\n\t\t\tIf the first strike connects %d random talent cooldowns are reduced by 1.\n\t\t\tIf the second strike connects you are cleansed of %d debuffs.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用武器攻击造成 %d%% 光系伤害，再用盾牌攻击造成 %d%% 光系伤害。\n\t\t\t如果第一次攻击命中，随机 %d 个技能冷却时间减少1回合。\n\t\t\t如果第二次攻击命中，除去你身上至多 %d 个 debuff。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f63452858c5a105777e8d2805c1395fc20982b87ce156fd7b90b5d4255eec324","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ac6abc1eb79734077532ea1be18617aedd260c8abe8e42f2cc8daea07474a60a","logical_entry_identity":"ffa0b99ce9dbf0ddb7d6bc08c314db457b26150dcb37739d8f42b130122341f3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"steel waraxe","source_tag":"entity name","target":"钢斧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e385a5f9b48272069d2ffd6e924eacd74e0723b5cfe0e53ab5795a2dd6b37201","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ac6f0d8181ebde86d18040936d2af2350ecbeffb220f0be9fb7f54840b1b0f15","logical_entry_identity":"5b0d5f28186f9b04c3b8c9e1bc98113d9a559a7a9a44eeacd750db64050e328d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The ground shakes as this huge worm burrows towards you, its gigantic mouth just as capable of devouring flesh as stone.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这只巨大的沙虫挖地道靠近你时，大地在震颤。它的巨口既能吞噬血肉，也能吞下石头。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a006284709cbbec0f9bd26bbbd82955a6bf321b3f4041e124fb5f6d17d9d5b9f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ac6f82a5636d20218b41b3e4cd12c9c6855b213b8635095866a0038d14c403d0","logical_entry_identity":"2ee4ef176783cd360b91fea061885710ed86af7d839c7e1f3652e5c8aab08f92","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"While activ